# v1 improved: order from the simulator's search (Orc Horde, 2000000 tries, seeded with v1's order;
# 124.5 h -> 116.8 h to 60 in the model), written by polestar apply-route.
# Added here: Pawn Captures Queen (4507), The Rise of the Machines (4062).
# Left out: Uncle Carlin (5241).
# 4 goals moved in from other guides of the chain.
# The notes above describe v1's order; the steps below are the improved one.

step Un'Goro Crater
  zone Un'Goro Crater
  goto 41.9,2.7 "Un'Goro Crater"
# Built from the playthrough simulator's consensus route (Horde, visits
# 65-69) and machine-checked with lint; not play-tested on Forever yet.
#
# Flow: Broken Pillar -> down into Un'Goro Crater -> Marshal's Refuge (flight
# path) -> loop 1, anticlockwise: tar pits, the western jungle, the
# south-west, the Gorishi hive, the raft, Torwa, the eastern jungle, the
# gorillas, Fire Plume Ridge (Ringo) -> escort Ringo to the refuge -> loop 2:
# northern pylon, eastern pylon, Lar'korwi, Torwa, western pylon, Krakle,
# Fire Plume Ridge's vent, Krakle -> refuge -> hearth to Gadgetzan -> fly to
# Orgrimmar (Hunters and Shamans train; Druids train in Thunder Bluff on the
# way), zeppelin to Grom'gol, fly to Kargath -> ride through Blackrock
# Mountain to Flame Crest (flight path) -> broodlings -> Dreadmaul Rock ->
# Thaurissan dig site -> Flame Crest -> fly to Kargath -> fly to the
# Undercity (training for the other classes) -> the Bulwark -> ride
# east to the Eastern Plaguelands: Terrordale -> Light's Hope Chapel (flight
# path, bind) -> Darrowshire -> hearth to Light's Hope Chapel, where the next
# guide starts.
#
# Deviations from the export:
# - Un'Goro is two loops: Torwa's chain is picked up before the gorillas so
#   their parts drop on the first pass, and Lar'korwi's bait waits for the
#   second loop, which passes his lair and Torwa again. J.D. Collie's crystals
#   are gathered on the first loop.
# - Finding the Source (974) needs level 51, which loop 1 starts below: Krakle
#   is visited on loop 2 instead, with a ride east to Fire Plume Ridge's vent
#   and back (about three minutes), instead of a grind before loop 1.
# - Dropped: The Mighty U'cha (4301): U'cha lives in the north-east cave and
#   Torwa in the south-east corner, so it costs two extra crossings of the
#   crater for 5,650 XP.
# - Grind: level 52 at the Lakkari Tar Pits before leaving the crater, so
#   The Rise of the Machines (4061, Kargath) can be taken on arrival.
# - Super Sticky (4504) and Bungle in the Jungle (4496) are turned in when the
#   hearth lands in Gadgetzan instead of on a later Tanaris visit.
# - The Kargath bind is dropped (replaced unused); the Light's Hope Chapel
#   bind is made on arrival there, not in the Badlands.
# - The Undercity and Bulwark stops of the previous guide's export (visits
#   56, 60, 61) are made here, on the way to the Plaguelands: Andron Gant
#   (3542/3564), A Call to Arms (5094), Seeping Corruption (3568), Scarlet
#   Diversions (5096), Argent Dawn Commission (5405), the Bulwark's
#   Scourgestones (5407, 5408) and A Plague Upon Thee (5901). A Call to Arms
#   is handed in on the spot.
# - Eastern Plaguelands: Terrordale first, since the road from the west
#   passes it; Pamela's doll and Zaeldarr are done in one trip south-west from
#   the chapel.
# - Dropped: The Rise of the Machines part 2 (4062: a detour to Lotwil for
#   1,350 XP), Dark Iron Legacy (3801: Franclorn is a ghost only a dead
#   character can see), Vivian Lagrave (4133: not taken, see the previous
#   guide) and Yuka Screwspigot (4324).
# - Optional: the Scourgestone turn-ins (5407, 5408, 5509, 5510). They are
#   repeatable Argent Dawn turn-ins and need 20 Minion's or 10 Invader's
#   Scourgestones each, which only drop while the Argent Dawn Commission is
#   equipped; hand them in whenever you have enough.
# - Back at Marshal's Refuge, Shizzle at the entrance first; in the
#   Undercity, Harbinger Balthazad beside the bat master first.
#
# Left open for later guides: The New Springs (980) and It's a Secret to
# Everybody (3908, Donova Snowden), Marvon's Workshop (4147), Felnok
# Steelspring (4808, Everlook), Auntie Marlene (5152), Scarlet Diversions
# (5096), A Plague Upon Thee (5901), Andron's Payment to Jediga (3564),
# Seeping Corruption (3568), Bone-Bladed Weapons (4300) and Un'Goro Soil
# (3761).
#
# Left out (not in the route): Dadanga is Hungry! (5150) and the pylon buffs
# (4381-4386, no experience), Chasing A-Me 01 parts 2-3 (Engineering) and Pawn
# Captures Queen (4507, elite boss).
#
# Checked and not added: The Mighty U'cha (4301) is still out (see above).
# Linken's Adventure (3961) needs Aquementas (4005), the end of Linken's
# Felwood and Tanaris chain, which no guide does before here. Target:
# Writhing Haunt and its return (5233, 5234) and Mission Accomplished! (5238)
# need the earlier cauldrons (5229-5232, 5235-5236). The route only starts the
# cauldrons in the next guide and finishes them at 58.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Marshal's Refuge

step Into Un'Goro Crater
  tip From the Broken Pillar ride west to the long ramp that winds down into Un'Goro Crater, then follow the crater's north wall to Marshal's Refuge, a camp in the cliff caves. Everyone here is neutral.
  getfp "Marshal's Refuge"
  accept 4284                         -- J.D. Collie, at the back of the cave; below ground
  accept 3882                         -- Spark Nilminer
  accept 3883                         -- Hol'anyee Marshal
  accept 3881                         -- Williden Marshal
  accept 4145                         -- Larion

step Bloodpetal Thresher on the way
  along until q4145-2
  kill 6511 quest 4145.4

step Super Sticky Tar on the way
  along until q4145-2
  when onquest 4504
  collect 11834 quest 4504

step Out of the refuge
  accept 4503                         -- Shizzle, at the refuge entrance
  accept 4243                         -- Karna Remtravel, just outside
  note From here on pick up every Power Crystal (blue, green, red, yellow) and every Un'Goro Soil pile you pass: 25 soil in all, 20 for Hamuul and 5 for Pestlezugg.

step Webbed Diemetradon Scale on the way
  along until q4503
  collect 11830 quest 4503.1

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Loop 1: south and south-east

step The Gorishi hive
  label q4503
  tip The silithid hive fills the south of the crater. Gorishi wasps and workers drop the scent gland; use the Scraping Vial on the egg mass inside the first chamber. The Hive Queen at the bottom is an elite boss: stay out of her chamber. Pterrordax nest on the cliffs above the hive; their scales are for Shizzle.
  collect 11831 quest 4503.2
  collect 11830 quest 4503.1

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Loop 1: Fire Plume Ridge
step Lakkari Tar Pits: kill these as you meet them
  label q4145-2
  zone Un'Goro Crater
  tip The tar pits lie just south of the refuge. Tar Beasts, Lurkers and Creepers drop the Super Sticky Tar.
  tip Ride south-west to Fire Plume Ridge, the volcano in the middle of the crater. Bloodpetal Flayers grow around its foot.
  tip The crystal clusters stand all over the crater, many around Fire Plume Ridge. Take a few extra of each colour for the pylons.
  tip Careful: Gorishi Workers may call for help within 25 yd when below 45% health; silithids cast Silithid Pox and Tunnelers and the Hive Guard use Tunneler Acid.
  collect 11018 quest 3761
  kill 6511 quest 4145.4
  collect 11834 quest 4504
  kill 6510 quest 4145.3
  level 51.05                          -- grind on Bloodpetal Trapper

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Loop 1: west and south-west

step Un'Goro Crater: kill these as you meet them
  zone Un'Goro Crater
  tip South of the hot springs, Stegodons graze and Dinosaur Bones drop from them or lie on the ground; Diemetradons nearby carry the scales Shizzle wants. Ravasaurs hunt in packs in the south-west: their claws are for Jes'rimon, and now and then one carries a Mangled Journal (a rare drop: take its quest only if you get one). Avoid Gruff, a level 57 Stegodon.
  tip Ride south-west along the western cliffs. Frenzied Pterrordax fly over the west side, and Bloodpetal Trappers grow in the same jungle.
  collect 11114 quest 3882
  kill 6512 quest 4145.2
  level 51.15                          -- grind on Elder Diemetradon

