step Into the Searing Gorge
  zone Searing Gorge
  tip Take the pass out of Kargath's west side into the Searing Gorge, then ride south across the gorge to the long bridge into Blackrock Mountain. Inside, follow the chain walkways down and leave through the southern exit; stay off the paths to the dungeon portals.
  goto 34.8,83.0 "Bridge into Blackrock Mountain"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Burning Steppes

step Flame Crest
  zone Burning Steppes
  tip The mountain lets you out beside Blackrock Stronghold, full of 55-57 orcs. Follow the road east along the northern cliffs to the Horde camp at Flame Crest.
  getfp "Flame Crest"
  accept 4296                         -- Maxwort Uberglint
  accept 4726                         -- Tinkee Steamboil

step Ruins of Thaurissan: kill these as you meet them
  zone Burning Steppes
  tip Black Broodlings nest in the hills just east of Flame Crest. Use Tinkee's Draco-Incarcinatrix 900 on a broodling when it is almost dead to capture its essence.
  tip Ride west to the dig site. War Reaver golems (53) stomp around it and drop the shards often; the Tablet of the Seven stands in its middle among the Thaurissan dwarves. Copy it.
  collect 11266 quest 4061
  collect 12283 quest 4726 @81.0,28.0
  use 12284 quest 4726.1 @81.0,28.0 map 1428
  collect 11470 quest 4296 @54.1,40.8

